ent Manager on January 16, 2026*"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01G5mhC1Bq6wU7CgvkPKH8A6', 'name': 'git_status', 'input': {'include_history': True, 'history_count': 5}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01G5mhC1Bq6wU7CgvkPKH8A6', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "advanced-exploration-protocol", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "ocs/current/AGENT_HIERARCHY.md", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "leadership/development_manager.md", "status": "M"}], "untracked": []}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "11795c99f252d77ca52335909df53beb27f8b054", "message": "Add comprehensive task resolution strategy documentation", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "5 minutes ago"}, "history": [{"hash": "11795c99f252d77ca52335909df53beb27f8b054", "message": "Add comprehensive task resolution strategy documentation", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "5 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "c8d5d5e2f8db4e36d1904fc60c0337adbac1b5c8", "message": "Continue exploration phase: Systematic investigation and progress tracking", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "5 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "d1984942f2688a27ed2f3743028e0a500de0e049", "message": "Advance exploration phase: Preparing for potential implementation pathways", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "5 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "42a2ba7e86cc2cd0baf599f8a62eda19a30b7fcc", "message": "Add comprehensive scenario analysis matrix for undefined task resolution", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "6 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "a54a441437622b6485dbde4d5bfabc67069a9d4f", "message": "Create undefined task resolution framework document", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "6 minutes ago"}], "stash_count": 0}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': "You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\n\n\n## Instructions\n\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{}\