ment report\\n- Document question handling system architecture\\n- Create workflow examples\\n- Document API changes\\n- Collect and document metrics\\n- Commit all changes with proper messages\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Project Success Criteria Summary\\n\\n\\u2705 Token usage reduced by 35-40% per execution  \\n\\u2705 API calls have retry logic with exponential backoff  \\n\\u2705 Circuit breaker prevents cascade failures  \\n\\u2705 Agents can pause for user questions and resume with answers  \\n\\u2705 Question Marshal resolves 60-70% questions internally  \\n\\u2705 All tests passing (95+ tests)  \\n\\u2705 No redundant instructions in agent definitions  \\n\\u2705 Test writers have clear file creation authority  \\n\\u2705 Complete documentation of all changes  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Risk Assessment\\n\\n**Low Risk**:\\n- Token optimization (non-breaking)\\n- Documentation updates\\n\\n**Medium Risk**:\\n- Runtime resilience integration (needs thorough testing)\\n- Question handling system (new functionality)\\n\\n**Mitigation**:\\n- Comprehensive test coverage\\n- Backward compatibility validation\\n- Incremental rollout per milestone\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Total Estimated Duration**: 7-11 days  \\n**Critical Path**: Milestone 1 \\u2192 Milestone 2 \\u2192 Milestone 3 \\u2192 Milestone 4 \\u2192 Milestone 5\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Lxq7mhz4WC9KncpmHpWPg3', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': './src/field/ensemble_ui/output/project_completion_m2.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Lxq7mhz4WC9KncpmHpWPg3', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Project Completion Report: Milestone 2 Integration and Testing\\n\\n## Project Summary\\n**Project ID**: 190432b7  \\n**Project Name**: Milestone 2 Integration and Testing  \\n**Completion Date**: January 16, 2026  \\n**Status**: \\u2705 COMPLETED\\n\\n## Milestone Achievements\\n\\n### Primary Objectives - ALL COMPLETED \\u2705\\n- \\u2705 Complete comprehensive testing of tracking mechanism\\n- \\u2705 Verify performance and compatibility  \\n- \\u2705 Validate error handling and context propagation\\n\\n### Quality Metrics Achieved\\n| Metric | Target | Achieved | Status |\\n|--------|--------|----------|---------|\\n| Unit Test Coverage | 90% | 95% | \\u2705 Exceeded |\\n| Integration Test Coverage | 85% | 92% | \\u2705 Exceeded |\\n| Performance Overhead | < 1ms | 0.8ms | \\u2705 Met |\\n| Memory Usage | < 1MB | 0.6MB | \\u2705 Met |\\n| Request Count Accuracy | 99% | 100% | \\u2705 Exceeded |\\n| Backward Compatibility | 100% | 100% | \\u2705 Met |\\n\\n### Quality Gates Status\\n- \\u2705 90% Test Coverage \\u2192 **95% Achieved**\\n- \\u2705 Performance Overhead Verified \\u2192 **0.8ms < 1ms target**\\n- \\u2705 Zero Breaking Changes \\u2192 **Fully compatible**\\n- \\u2705 All Existing Tests Pass \\u2192 **100% pass rate**\\n\\n## Technical Deliverables\\n1. **Comprehensive Test Suite**: 95% unit coverage, 92% integration coverage\\n2. **Performance Validation**: Sub-millisecond overhead confirmed\\n3. **Compatibility Verification**: Zero breaking changes, full backward compatibility\\n4. **Error Handling Validation**: Context propagation working correctly\\n5. **Documentation**: Complete test results and performance metrics\\n\\n## Performance Excellence\\n- **Tracking overhead**: 0.8ms (20% under target)\\n- **Memory efficiency**: 0.6MB (40% under limit)\\n- **Accuracy**: 100% request count tracking\\n- **Compatibility**: 100% maintained with existing interfaces\\n\\n## Project Impact\\nThe enhanced tracking mechanism provides reliable, high-performance monitoring with zero disruption to existing functionality. All testing objectives exceeded expectations, providing high confidence for production deployment.\\n\\n## Next Steps\\nProject is complete and ready for final delivery to stakeholders. All quality gates passed with margin for safety.\\n\\n---\\n*Completed by Development Manager on January 16, 2026*"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01G5mhC1Bq6wU7CgvkPKH8A6', 'name': 'git_status', 'input': {'include_history': True, 'history_count': 5}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01G5mhC1Bq6wU7CgvkPKH8A6', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "advanced-exploration-protocol", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "ocs/current/AGENT_HIERARCHY.md", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "leadership/development_manager.md", "status": "M"}], "untracked": []}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "11795c99f252d77ca52335909df53beb27f8b054", "message": "Add comprehensive task resolution strategy documentation", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "5 minutes ago"}, "history": [{"hash": "11795c99f252d77ca52335909df53beb27f8b054", "message": "Add comprehensive task resolution strategy documentation", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "5 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "c8d5d5e2f8db4e36d1904fc60c0337adbac1b5c8", "message": "Continue exploration phase: Systematic investigation and progress tracking", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "5 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "d1984942f2688a27ed2f3743028e0a500de0e049", "message": "Advance exploration phase: Preparing for potential implementation pathways", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "5 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "42a2ba7e86cc2cd0baf599f8a62eda19a30b7fcc", "message": "Add comprehensive scenario analysis matrix for undefined task resolution", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "6 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "a54a441437622b6485dbde4d5bfabc67069a9d4f", "message": "Create undefined task resolution framework document", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "6 minutes ago"}], "stash_count": 0}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01XRdbvTkebDLbcxkkKqV6TN', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find . -name "*.md" -path "*milestone*" -o -name "*resilience*" -o -