stone 2: Backend API Implementation\\n**Objective**: Create FastAPI endpoints for task decomposition\\n**Duration**: 2-3 days\\n**Deliverables**:\\n- POST /api/decompose endpoint\\n- POST /api/approve-plan endpoint\\n- GET /api/decomposition-history endpoint\\n- Request/response schemas with Pydantic\\n- Persistent storage for decomposition history\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- All endpoints functional and return proper JSON\\n- Input validation with meaningful error messages\\n- History persistence across server restarts\\n- API documentation via FastAPI auto-docs\\n- Integration tests for all endpoints\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 (requires core engine)\\n\\n## Milestone 3: Frontend Visualization\\n**Objective**: Build React components for task visualization\\n**Duration**: 3-4 days\\n**Deliverables**:\\n- TaskDecompositionViewer.jsx component\\n- Mermaid.js dependency graph rendering\\n- Resource estimates display\\n- Execution wave visualization\\n- Approve/Reject/Modify action buttons\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Interactive Mermaid graphs render correctly\\n- Resource estimates clearly displayed\\n- Execution waves show parallel task groups\\n- User actions trigger appropriate API calls\\n- Responsive design works on different screen sizes\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 2 (requires API endpoints)\\n\\n## Milestone 4: Integration & Testing\\n**Objective**: Full system integration and comprehensive testing\\n**Duration**: 2-3 days\\n**Deliverables**:\\n- End-to-end integration\\n- Comprehensive test suite\\n- Performance optimization\\n- Documentation\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Full workflow from input to visualization works\\n- All components properly integrated\\n- Performance meets requirements\\n- Complete technical documentation\\n- User guide created\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestones 1-3\\n\\n## Total Project Duration: 10-15 days\\n## Critical Success Factors:\\n- Accurate task decomposition logic\\n- Efficient dependency graph generation\\n- Clear and useful visualizations\\n- Reliable API responses\\n- Comprehensive test coverage\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01EH5WovhaEZdcje1wdtu5RD', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': '9ef2636d', 'description': 'Review current milestone status and identify next priority tasks', 'assigned_to': 'project_coordinator'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01EH5WovhaEZdcje1wdtu5RD', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "319c7f64", "message": "Added task: Review current milestone status and identify next priority tasks"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01HSUTVEBU7ZHAXA2tsL4ba3', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'code_writer', 'input_data': {'project_context': 'Smart Task Decomposition Engine', 'current_milestone': 'Milestone 3: Frontend Visualization', 'target_component': 'TaskDecompositionViewer.jsx', 'requirements': {'features': ['Mermaid.js dependency graph rendering', 'Resource estimates display', 'Execution wave visualization', 'Approve/Reject/Modify action buttons'], 'design_constraints': ['Responsive design', 'Integration with backend API', 'Clear and interactive visualization']}}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01HSUTVEBU7ZHAXA2tsL4ba3', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Unknown agent type: code_writer. Agent definition file not found."}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': "You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\n\n\n## Instructions\n\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nYou must respond with JSON matching this exact format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## When to Request Clarification\nRequest clarification when:\n\n\n## Termination Conditions\nYou are done when:\n\n\nCRITICAL: Your response must be valid JSON matching t